```
# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Build outputs
dist/
build/
target/

# TypeScript/JavaScript build artifacts
*.js.map
*.tsbuildinfo

# Environment variables
.env
.env.local
*.env.*

# IDE files
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# Logs
*.log

# Coverage reports
coverage/
htmlcov/
*.coverage

# Temporary files
*.tmp
*.temp

# Python cache (if any Python files were detected in the project)
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd

# Testing
.vitest/

# OS generated files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Database migration files (if using drizzle)
.drizzle/
```